{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHoptale\u300b is a Roguelite with a core of \u201cHopscotch \u00d7 Slot Machine.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, fish, and solve puzzles through hopscotch gameplay; <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, the tiles transform into a slot machine, and you must lock onto safe paths to defeat monsters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even loot and rewards are decided by the slot machine\u2014your fate lies in your reflexes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/6320aacc132080fd30c094e1a2c1d6ff.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/6320aacc132080fd30c094e1a2c1d6ff.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in the hero\u2019s village, where you set out to rescue villagers and your missing sister, kidnapped by cultists of the Evil God. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet many characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/9817a32db60db0682f2c518b7cffdaf3.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/9817a32db60db0682f2c518b7cffdaf3.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/9817a32db60db0682f2c518b7cffdaf3.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this land already corrupted by the Evil God, face off against mighty bosses! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/b4ffd55ca1adb0ca26fcd4a4cbb131ab.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/b4ffd55ca1adb0ca26fcd4a4cbb131ab.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/b4ffd55ca1adb0ca26fcd4a4cbb131ab.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/816fdaca491b64800247cd3dd74d3e40.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/816fdaca491b64800247cd3dd74d3e40.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/816fdaca491b64800247cd3dd74d3e40.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your base, unlock new playable characters, and experiment with countless grid effects to create bizarre and unique builds! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a0e662abd4a8ee5ff3537ae43b2fb179.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a0e662abd4a8ee5ff3537ae43b2fb179.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a0e662abd4a8ee5ff3537ae43b2fb179.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Events on Your Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/d0e6c7f9fea2d87e780afb4187e1be1d.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/d0e6c7f9fea2d87e780afb4187e1be1d.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/d0e6c7f9fea2d87e780afb4187e1be1d.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventure, bosses may suddenly give chase,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but\u2014but\u2014don\u2019t panic! Who knows, maybe while running away you\u2019ll stumble upon legendary gear (?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles, shops, gathering, and even upgrades\u2014all decided by slot machine results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/c61c13c6fc11c10777766892d1cc3de0.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/c61c13c6fc11c10777766892d1cc3de0.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/c61c13c6fc11c10777766892d1cc3de0.mp4?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as your reflexes are fast enough, you can turn the impossible into possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>\u300aHoptale\uff0dDemo\u300b</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the game\u2019s core mechanics and a full 30\u201360 minute gameplay session, featuring the following content:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge three unique bosses \u2014 \u201cCult Cat,\u201d \u201cThe Giant Fish in the Pond,\u201d and a mysterious hidden boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2 Story Chapters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the prologue from the full version and a special demo-exclusive chapter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1 Playable Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the starting hero, Tubi the Bunny, and experience the fundamental gameplay system!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Demo Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo will continue to receive updates \u2014 stay tuned for the addition of a new starting character, Meowki!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancement and relic systems are also currently in development.</p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/abaf0dc217bc0e13a4643fcc1063cb10.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/abaf0dc217bc0e13a4643fcc1063cb10.webm?t=1761407549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, please add it to your Wishlist! (Pretty please)</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094560?t=1761407549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094560?t=1761407549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/5a573cbf5702a210d6d563a88252c460ee95bd6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761407549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/5a573cbf5702a210d6d563a88252c460ee95bd6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761407549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHoptale\u300b is a Roguelite with a core of \u201cHopscotch \u00d7 Slot Machine.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, fish, and solve puzzles through hopscotch gameplay; <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094560/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.poster.avif?t=1761407549\" width=614 hei